  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EU GCC Dialogue on Economic diversification II</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Overall Objective of this action is to enhance EU-GCC trade and investment relations in line with the EU Joint Communication and to promote EU business interests, while contributing to the economic diversification in the GCC countries. The project will continue the previous EU GCC Economic Diversification dialogue projects&#xbf; (2018-2024) objectives and will deepen the engagement with GCC counterparts on generating business and trade opportunities for EU businesses, particularly European SMEs, and supporting economic diversification in the GCC countries by sharing EU best practices</narrative>
  </description>
